<div class="area-love-section"><div class="area-love-inner">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
                <img src="/images/camberwell.png" alt="Camberwell" class="area-love-img">
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="area-love-card">
                    <h2>Why we love Camberwell</h2>
                    <p>Thanks to the new Cross-Rail trainline near Denmark Hill, Camberwell is now firmly on the map for prospective buyers looking for an inner-London property and a fast journey into the city centre &#x2013; and it&#x2019;s easy to see why.</p>
                    <p>Whilst Camberwell property prices have risen in recent years, they are still more affordable than some of the neighbouring areas and offer great value for money. From period properties with large gardens to an abundance of luscious green parks and excellent schools &#x2013; Camberwell caters to everyone.</p>
                    <p>Home to one of the world&#x2019;s leading art institutions, a creative vibe permeates the area, and its caf&#xe9; culture and lively restaurant scene make Camberwell a great choice for buy-to-let investors.</p>
                    <p>Think Camberwell could be the place for you? Get in touch with our team to start your search.</p>
                    <a href="/contact" class="area-btn-filled">Talk to our team</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

